{"segment_id": "segment_00001", "start": 30.0, "end": 60.0, "speech": "好, where,对吧？到哪里你要去准备去 be going to do？三十七课、三十九课咱们学的计划打算. Spend your holidays.度过你的假期。六十七课我没记错，咱们学过 this year.叫做今年，对吧？今年你准备去哪儿度假呢？Gary回答，他说 We may go abroad. How may加do表示一种可能，对不对？表示对现在或未来的一个推测，叫做我们可能会出国。这儿还有一个小的短语", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000005.webp", "time": 46.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["83101", "MSN", "MARTIN: Where are you going to", "spend your holidays this year, Gary?", "GARY: We may go abroad.", "I'm not sure.", "My wife wants go to Egypt.", "I'd like to there, too.", "We can't make up our minds."], "scores": [0.65191, 0.509, 0.96334, 0.98512, 0.9705, 0.98039, 0.97805, 0.9796, 0.95228], "boxes": [[[455.0, 122.0], [561.0, 114.0], [564.0, 158.0], [458.0, 166.0]], [[61.0, 475.0], [395.0, 469.0], [396.0, 522.0], [62.0, 527.0]], [[59.0, 543.0], [828.0, 552.0], [827.0, 617.0], [58.0, 607.0]], [[59.0, 610.0], [887.0, 610.0], [887.0, 676.0], [59.0, 676.0]], [[58.0, 669.0], [681.0, 671.0], [681.0, 738.0], [58.0, 735.0]], [[61.0, 735.0], [353.0, 743.0], [352.0, 794.0], [60.0, 786.0]], [[58.0, 792.0], [683.0, 794.0], [683.0, 863.0], [58.0, 861.0]], [[58.0, 854.0], [528.0, 863.0], [527.0, 919.0], [57.0, 910.0]], [[58.0, 914.0], [735.0, 916.0], [735.0, 979.0], [58.0, 977.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
