{"segment_id": "segment_00003", "start": 90.0, "end": 120.0, "speech": "wife，第三人称单数，所以后边的 want 后边加了个 s，对不对？说他想去埃及，I'd like to go there too。之前我们学过，应该是一百零七课，would like to do something，叫做想，其实跟 want 基本是一个含义，对吧？就 I want to go there，I want to go there，啊，等于 I would like to go there too。说我也想去那里。We can't make up our minds。这是一个小的短语啊，我们新一", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000007.webp", "time": 106.0, "ocr": {"texts": [" 11y", "3101", "MSN", "MARTIN: Where are you going to", "spend your holidays this year, Gary?", "GARY: We may go abroad.", "I'm not sure.", "My wife wants go to Egypt.", "I'd like to there, too.", "We can't make up our minds."], "scores": [0.615, 0.74671, 0.54694, 0.96025, 0.98604, 0.9763, 0.97905, 0.97806, 0.98226, 0.93738], "boxes": [[[574.0, 62.0], [701.0, 55.0], [703.0, 90.0], [576.0, 97.0]], [[454.0, 123.0], [561.0, 114.0], [565.0, 157.0], [458.0, 166.0]], [[61.0, 475.0], [397.0, 469.0], [398.0, 522.0], [62.0, 527.0]], [[59.0, 543.0], [828.0, 552.0], [827.0, 617.0], [58.0, 607.0]], [[59.0, 610.0], [887.0, 610.0], [887.0, 676.0], [59.0, 676.0]], [[58.0, 669.0], [681.0, 671.0], [681.0, 738.0], [58.0, 735.0]], [[61.0, 735.0], [353.0, 743.0], [352.0, 794.0], [60.0, 786.0]], [[58.0, 792.0], [683.0, 794.0], [683.0, 863.0], [58.0, 861.0]], [[58.0, 854.0], [528.0, 862.0], [527.0, 917.0], [57.0, 910.0]], [[58.0, 914.0], [735.0, 916.0], [735.0, 979.0], [58.0, 977.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
