{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "travel by sea.我们可能坐船吧。哦，你注意may加do，依旧又到这个地方了。什么问题呢？就不确定，对吧？这是我们刚刚在上一个视频当中学到的一个关键结构。Is cheaper, isn't it?啊，这个Martin说了，说哎更便宜，isn't it？前口后否，前肯后否，前前肯后否，前否后肯，对吧？时态人称保持一致，反义疑问", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000011.webp", "time": 205.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["111y", "3101", "SN", "MARTIN: Will you travel by sea or air?", "GARY: We may travel by sea.", "MARTIN: It's cheaper, isn't it?", "GARY: It may be cheaper.", "but it takes a long time.", "MARTIN: I'm sure you'll enjoy yourselves.", "GART: Don't be so sure."], "scores": [0.52058, 0.73776, 0.54757, 0.94995, 0.97809, 0.9835, 0.97909, 0.95605, 0.96461, 0.9629], "boxes": [[[575.0, 63.0], [701.0, 57.0], [702.0, 91.0], [576.0, 97.0]], [[455.0, 124.0], [560.0, 115.0], [564.0, 157.0], [459.0, 166.0]], [[62.0, 477.0], [395.0, 471.0], [396.0, 521.0], [63.0, 526.0]], [[58.0, 547.0], [923.0, 547.0], [923.0, 612.0], [58.0, 612.0]], [[60.0, 606.0], [725.0, 615.0], [724.0, 676.0], [59.0, 668.0]], [[58.0, 670.0], [732.0, 672.0], [732.0, 735.0], [58.0, 733.0]], [[59.0, 730.0], [652.0, 737.0], [652.0, 798.0], [59.0, 792.0]], [[60.0, 792.0], [606.0, 798.0], [606.0, 858.0], [60.0, 851.0]], [[58.0, 853.0], [1007.0, 853.0], [1007.0, 921.0], [58.0, 921.0]], [[63.0, 917.0], [616.0, 923.0], [616.0, 976.0], [63.0, 970.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
